Videx is live as a YouTube-first AI coding knowledge base.

- **Hardened YouTube scrapers**: InnerTube Android/Web/iOS fallback chain for captions and channel analytics.
- **AI enrichment pipeline**: automatic tagging, topics, summaries, and sentiment with **GPT-5.6 Luna**.
- **Transcript-grounded chat**: ask questions about any video with interactive citations.
- **Fast full-text & semantic search**: powered by PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector and Fastify.

